{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月27日 19:04 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（27日）下午4時許，警方接獲報案，指一名男子在青衣担杆山路88號操作起重機時，被吊臂壓到受傷，吊臂亦跌落海。救援人員到場尋獲70多歲男傷者，他半清醒，仍有呼吸及脈搏，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院。案件暫時列作工業意外、有人受傷。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>現場消息指，男事主是上址船廠老闆，當時正使用起重機吊運貨物，其間出意外，連人帶機墮海，附近街坊見狀報警。初步消息指，事主腳部受傷骨折。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕船廠 工業意外 有人受傷 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.739357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:26.304887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:24.413996+00:00","content_hash":"b8895ab380b11f5123e81cbf1cdc36c64f606e51f5ad703029e817a041050c92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}